Foreign Buyers Will Be Charged Higher Platine Duty When Purchasing a Property in the UK
Foreign buyers are allowed to pay higher cloak duty when they buy property in the UK, and the extra money is used to help homeless, according to the Tory party's new plans
The measure will neutralize Corbyn's success in attracting young electors
