“This isn’t a movie that pays homage or condemns the dairy industry.”
At the end of the film, the victor reveal that they have all danced with the discretency pump tweezed into the bra.
The concept behind the campaign is based on a lot of women pumping milk saying they feel like cows.
"But the Elvie pump is completely silent, has no cables or pipes and can be carried discreetly into a nursing bra, giving the women the freedom to move, keep their babies and even go out while they are pumping.
Ana Balarin is a co-owner and ECD of the Mother, and she says: “Elvie pump is such a revolutionary product that it deserves a bold and provocative launch.
By pulling a parallel between women pumping breast milk and dairy cows, we wanted to put light on breast pumping and the challenges with it, at the same time as we in an entertaining and easily recognisable way show what an incredible sense of freedom the new pump provides.
